"""A detector for eng/engine spellings and engineering translations.

Engineering and short 'eng' fragments have the largest response. Engine
words are also strong; engagement, English/England and angle spellings are
weaker. Chinese engineering/engine words and Japanese en/ngu fragments
also respond. Case, word boundaries and a few split-word continuations
change the strength. Unrecognized tokens are predicted as zero.
